Tameness is not a simple switch - things can be more tame or less tame. 
Doing mean things to a pet, for example hitting them, displacing them onto 
a trap or leaving them alone for too long makes them less tame. Each time a 
pet eats, it becomes more tame. So either don't leave your pets on another 
level, or feed them well before you do. Generally you can lock them up 
somewhere on a level if you don't want a priest to be killed.

